### Variable font axes reference

| Axis | Code | Range | Default | Usage |
|------|------|-------|---------|-------|
| Weight | `wght` | 300–800 | 400 | Light to extra-bold |
| Monospace | `MONO` | 0–1 | 0 | Proportional to monospace |
